  {
    "path": "enforcingNotice",
    "display": "This operation enforces. <b>On Threat</b> decides what happens to anything flagged, and flagged items leave through the <b>Flagged</b> output instead of the main path.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "reportOnlyNotice",
    "display": "Reports risk without blocking, but it still routes: anything it flags leaves through <b>Flagged</b>. Connect that output to stop the item, or leave it unconnected to drop it.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "redactNotice",
    "display": "Never blocks and never stops an item. The cleaned copy arrives as <code>{{ $json.outputText }}</code> on the single output; the text you pass in is not modified in place.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "auditNotice",
    "display": "The workflow JSON is analysed in-process and never sent to SoterAI. Static review only — it never executes the workflow or resolves a credential.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "enrollIdentityNotice",
    "display": "<b>Step 1 of 5:</b> Register the agent once, then pass <code>{{ $json.agentIdentityId }}</code> to <b>Issue Access Pass</b>.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "issuePassportNotice",
    "display": "<b>Step 2 of 5:</b> Issue a short-lived access pass for one session. Pass <code>sessionId</code> and <code>passportToken</code> by expression; never paste the token into workflow JSON.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "validatePassportNotice",
    "display": "<b>Step 3 of 5:</b> Validate the session and token. Session ID and Passport Token auto-pick from incoming item if left empty. Tool Name and Tool Action test authorization for a specific call.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "toolCallNotice",
    "display": "<b>Step 4 of 5:</b> Put this immediately before the real tool. ALLOW leaves through <b>Safe</b>; blocked, invalid, or approval-required calls leave through <b>Flagged</b>.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
  {
    "path": "revokePassportNotice",
    "display": "<b>Step 5 of 5:</b> Revoke by Session ID or Access Pass ID when the task ends. Successful revocation returns <code>PASSPORT_REVOKED</code> on <b>Safe</b>.",
    "type": "notice",
    "values": []
  },
